# Tempo 1, 2 and 3 ticks a frame and changes in a song.
TRACK
PROGRAM 0
VOLUME 100
TEMPO 75
NOTE 6 c4 v100
WAIT 6
TEMPO 150
NOTE 6 d4 v100
WAIT 6
TEMPO 225
NOTE 6 e4 v100
WAIT 6
TEMPO 60
NOTE 6 f4 v100
WAIT 6
TEMPO 211
@loop:
NOTE 4 g4 v100
WAIT 5
NOTE 4 a4 v90
WAIT 7
JUMP @loop
TRACK
PROGRAM 9
VOLUME 100
@l2:
NOTE 8 c3 v100
WAIT 9
JUMP @l2
